{
  "id": "xiaozhi-breadboard-oled",
  "name": "小智 · 面包板版（0.96 OLED · 零焊接）",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "updated": "2026-11-01",
  "_note": "接线数据以官方文档为准，模型只能引用、不能改写。官方来源：https://xiaozhi.me/xz-docs/docs/tutorial-basics/esp32-s3-bread-board-diy-wiring/",
  "source": {
    "official_wiring": "https://xiaozhi.me/xz-docs/docs/tutorial-basics/esp32-s3-bread-board-diy-wiring/",
    "firmware_repo": "https://github.com/78/xiaozhi-esp32",
    "console": "https://xiaozhi.me"
  },
  "board": {
    "model": "ESP32-S3 核心板 N16R8（嘉顺 / HW678 V0.0.0）",
    "mcu": "双核 Xtensa LX7",
    "flash": "16MB",
    "psram": "8MB",
    "usb_serial": "CH343P",
    "usb_ports": 2,
    "size_mm": [
      57,
      28
    ],
    "buttons": [
      "RST",
      "BOOT"
    ],
    "led": "板载 WS2812 RGB",
    "firmware_board_type": "bread-compact-wifi (Simplex 模式)",
    "traps": [
      "有 2 个 Type-C 口：左边「ESP32-S3 直通 USB&OTG」，右边「USB 转串口 CH343P」。刷固件用右边那个。",
      "5Vin 默认是输入脚，不出 5V。要出 5V 必须短接背面 IN-OUT 跳线（0 欧电阻）。本方案不需要。",
      "RGB 灯不亮，先看背面 RGB 两个焊点是否连通。"
    ]
  },
  "safety": {
    "rules": [
      "任何上电动作之前，先用万用表蜂鸣档测 3V3 与 GND 是否短路。官方文档作者就是因为面包板电源轨短路，烧坏过两块开发板的 USB 口。",
      "INMP441 和 OLED 只能接 3.3V，接 5V 直接烧。",
      "MAX98357A 的 VIN 接 3.3V（官方默认），不是 5V。",
      "接线时 USB 必须拔掉。"
    ]
  },
  "parts": [
